  "acceptance": [
    "Original immutable table/column/request binding and exact physical field-patch proof remain unchanged; no supplied staged key or patch inventory grants row authority.",
    "Original leaf counts partition final sorted key+ROW sequences. Overflowing leaves allocate new left and retain original right; internal partitions divide child count, not bounded-entry count.",
    "A non-root internal overflow allocates one new left tail-form node while original right retains its original bounded/tail form. An internal root allocates right, then left, retains original ID at height plus one and stores exactly two bounded maxima/tail zero.",
    "Final reciprocal sibling lists are derived for every height. Every bound contains the full numeric key and physical row reference, including ties.",
    "A separately implemented postorder replay derives capacities, final child topology, sequential EOF IDs and exact map events from the checked original and request-replayed keys; it does not consume builder arena decisions.",
    "Actual full entry/child streams, height, links, independent prefix/free/bitmap framing, original residual bytes and fresh zero padding are certified before fresh full catalog/table/index/field/relationship checks.",
    "Literal complete-image cases cover headers 5/6, ascending/descending, retained bounded/tail forms, NULL peer, real logical aliases, row-tie separators, both future allocations and exact malformed/unsupported map refusal, duplicate/stale requests, all three resource pools and late cancellation/retry.",
    "Parent-only overflow private controls establish a healthy final image, then reject forged root ROW bounds/height/tail/residue, new internal links/tail/padding and an unrequested future-free bit.",
    "The existing root-leaf algorithm, other preview APIs, ordinary save paths, update codec allowlist and all original mutation admission gates remain unchanged."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Engineering candidates are separate, non-journalable outputs. No Microsoft Access save, data-macro, locking or recovery qualification is claimed.",
    "Only the qualified single-Int32 split path is widened; other codecs/composites, ignore-NULL UPDATE blockers, map growth and arbitrary in-file free-page reuse remain outside this service.",
    "Both resulting halves must fit independently. Existing mutation/image/index-depth ceilings are unchanged; empty non-root leaves remain refused by original Tree::read and defensive builder/replay checks.",
    "Public writer root/below-root geometry is separate reference evidence. Its opaque scratch rewrites are not engineering byte goldens; this record includes no native original candidate replay."
  ],
